        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In ages past, this Pokémon\nwas revered as a bringer of rain.\nIt was found buried in the ground.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/21/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In ages past, this Pokémon\nwas revered as a bringer of rain.\nIt was found buried in the ground.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あまぐもを　よべる　ポケモンとして\nおおむかしから　まつられていた。\nときどき　じめんに　うめられている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "비구름을 부르는 포켓몬으로\n아주 옛날부터 떠받들어졌다.\n가끔 땅에 묻혀 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il a longtemps été célébré pour avoir apporté la pluie.\nOn le trouve parfois enterré dans le sol.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Man verehrt sie schon seit Urzeiten als Regenmacher.\nManchmal findet man eines von ihnen\nim Boden vergraben.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Desde antaño se adora a este Pokémon para que\npropicie lluvias abundantes. A veces se esconde bajo\ntierra.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È stato venerato per secoli come Pokémon che porta\nla pioggia. A volte lo si trova sepolto nel terreno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In ages past, this Pokémon was revered as a\nbringer of rain. It was found buried in the ground.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "雨雲を　呼べる　ポケモンとして\n大昔から　まつられていた。\nときどき　地面に　埋められている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Desde antaño se adora a este Pokémon para que\npropicie lluvias abundantes. A veces se esconde bajo\ntierra.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ドータクンに　いのりを　ささげると\nあめが　ふり　さくもつを　そだてると\nこだいの　ひとびとは　しんじていた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "동탁군에게 소원을 빌면\n비가 내려 농작물을 자라게 한다고\n고대의 사람들은 믿고 있었다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On croyait autrefois que lui adresser des prières\nfaisait pleuvoir et assurait les récoltes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Früher verehrten die Menschen die Bronzong,\nweil sie sich davon Regen oder gute Ernten erhofften.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Antaño se creía que rezándole se conjuraba la lluvia\ny se propiciaban las buenas cosechas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
